@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/tutorial-interactive-siege.puml
' purpose: narrow rook-siege to single-target beats — keep d4
' status: ACTIVE — focused lesson; product = StarChess
' covers: apps/starchess/src/tutorial/tutorialScript.config.ts
'         apps/starchess/src/demos/choreography/useSiegeFocusCounter.ts
' live spec: _spec/apps/starchess/architecture/storybook-projection.puml
'            _spec/apps/starchess/menu-flow.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
title Focused siege — keep d4 alive;\nkill h4 → d2 → d1 → d7 to 1 pawn

component "TUTORIAL_SCRIPT_CONFIG\nfog/rook-siege" as CFG <<app>>
component "siegeFocusCounter\nlesson choreography" as CHOREO <<app>>
component "TutorialScreen\nlive engine + gates" as RUN <<app>>
component "**lose d4**\nno siege tank" as LOSE <<error>>

CFG ARROW_MAIN RUN
CHOREO ARROW_QUEUE RUN : black intents
RUN ARROW_MAIN CHOREO : h4 stack, d2 fallback
LOSE ARROW_ERROR RUN : restartWhen S:d4

note bottom of RUN
  **Keep allied siege tank on d4.**
  Win when enemy has 1 pawn left.
  Lose when S:d4 is gone.
  Hints narrow: h4, then d2, d1, d7.
end note

note bottom of CHOREO
  **Black stacks h4 while it lives;**
  d2 promotion is fallback only.
  Ship pressures c1, never d4 outright.
  Generic adjutant stays untouched.
end note

legend bottom
  **Implement this file.**
  ==
  completeWhen 1 pawn in placement.
  restartWhen S:d4 gone.
  Diff tutorialScript.config.ts first.
end legend
@enduml
